OL,3,AWhite House blocks Microsoft from
OL,4,Aforeign worker hiring program
OL,5,
OL,6,FMicrosoft said most of the H1b visas
OL,7,Ffiled over the last financial year were
OL,8,Ffor existing workers, who are paid the
OL,9,Fsame as local staff.
